m our premium signature leatherette or fabric upholstery, offering you the option of sleek sophistication or cozy elegance. Your chair, your way.<\/p>","file_position":"bottom","file_type":"image","file_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/own_your_sit_Budapest_Major.webp","video_url":""}},"img_with_text_simplicity_y9w6bc":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":["{background: #ebebeb;}",".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: #d00012; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>LUXURY. <br\/>ENDURANCE. <br\/>SUSTAINABILITY <br\/>ALL IN ONE<\/p>","sub_title":"NEXGEN ECO LEATHERETTE","description":"<p>Experience the perfect fusion of luxury and durability with our sustainable leatherette. Delivering the premium feel of NAPA leather, it boasts 15 times the strength of standard PU, ensuring long-lasting performance while helping protect the planet.<\/p>","file_position":"right","file_type":"image","file_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SOFT_YET_FIRM_BEST_OF_BOTH_WORLDS_Budapest_Major.webp","video_url":""}},"img_with_text_simplicity_e8zHd8":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":["{background: #ebebeb;}",".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: #d00012; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>SOFT YET SUPPORTIVE – <\/p><p>THE PERFECT BALANCE<\/p>","sub_title":"ULTRA-SOFT MEMORY FOAM","description":"<p>Why settle for stiff, uncomfortable foam when our upgraded ultra-soft memory foam offers superior softness and lasting resilience? It cradles you in cloud-like comfort while providing the perfect support, designed to keep you comfortable, focused, and supported for years to come.<\/p>","file_position":"left","file_type":"image","file_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SOFT_YET_FIRM_BEST_OF_BOTH_WORLDS_Budapest_Major_seat.webp","video_url":""}},"img_with_text_simplicity_axWaGA":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":["{background: #ebebeb;}",".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw; padding-bottom: 6.25vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: #d00012; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>Upright or Reclined, <\/p><p>We’ve Got You Covered<\/p>","sub_title":"WIDE DESIGNED SEAT BASE","description":"<p>Engineered for every posture—whether upright, cross-legged, reclined, or leaning—our wider, more versatile seat base provides adaptive comfort that supports you in any position.<\/p>","file_position":"right","file_type":"image","file_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Upright_or_Not_We_ve_Got_You_Budapest_Major.webp","video_url":""}},"img_with_text_simplicity_V8MWmN":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":["{background: #ebebeb;}",".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw; padding-bottom: 6.25vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: #d00012; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>SGS CERTIFIED, MORE DURABILITY<\/p>","sub_title":"UPGRADED HYDRAULIC GAS PISTON","description":"<p>Now featuring KGS factory gas lifts, SGS certified, and offering up to class 4 pressure. With top-tier materials and exceptional performance in load support, drop, rotation, and impact tests, it’s built for long-lasting durability.<\/p>","file_position":"left","file_type":"image","file_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SGS_CERTIFIED_MORE_DURABILITY_Budapest_Major.webp","video_url":""}},"img_with_text_simplicity_pbNbgH":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":["{background: #ebebeb;}",".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: #d00012; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>Adjustable Lumbar Support<\/p>","sub_title":"INTEGRATED 4-WAY DYNAMIC LUMBAR SUPPORT","description":"<p>The lumbar support is the heart of any great gaming chair, and ours is exceptional. With adjustable height and depth, it ensures a perfect fit for your spine, delivering ultimate comfort and support. The backrest is enhanced with memory foam, offering even more softness and comfort while providing superior support for long gaming sessions.<\/p>","file_position":"bottom","file_type":"video","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/YOUR_LUMBAR_HAS_FOUND_ITS_MATCH_Budapest_Major.webp","video_url":"","url_upload":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/YOUR LUMBAR HAS FOUND ITS MATCH Budapest Major.webm"}},"img_with_text_simplicity_qJhzrx":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":["{background: #ebebeb;}",".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: #d00012; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>PRECISE ARM SUPPORT RELIEVE SHOULDER & ARM STRESS<\/p>","sub_title":"4-WAY DYNAMIC ARMREST","description":"<p>Our 4-Way Dynamic Armrests are engineered to support your natural posture, moving seamlessly in every direction to reduce stress on your muscles and joints. These armrests provide the perfect alignment to keep you supported and comfortable.<\/p>","file_position":"bottom","file_type":"video","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PRECISE_ARM_SUPPORT_RELIEVE_SHOULDER_ARM_STRESS_Budapest_Major.webp","video_url":"","url_upload":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/PRECISE ARM SUPPORT RELIEVE SHOULDER & ARM STRESS Budapest Major.webm"}},"img_with_text_simplicity_GcnqNM":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":["{background: #ebebeb;}",".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw; padding-bottom: 7.8125vw;}",".img_w