ial?","content":"<p>The Budapest Major 2025 Athena Pro is a limited-edition gaming chair created for the Major event. It combines the proven Athena Pro structure with exclusive event-themed design, making it a standout choice for esports fans.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_DezxNf":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"2. How is the Budapest Major 2025 edition different from the standard Athena Pro?","content":"<p>The main difference is the official Budapest Major branding and limited-edition design. Performance, comfort, and structural features remain the same as the original Athena Pro.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_eXNb4F":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"3. What ergonomic features does the Budapest Major 2025 Athena Pro offer?","content":"<p>It includes ultra-soft memory foam, 4-way adjustable lumbar support, a dynamic backrest and armrests, and a magnetic head pillow to help maintain proper posture and reduce fatigue during long gaming or working sessions.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_nJXDci":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"4. What materials are used in the Budapest Major 2025 Athena Pro Gaming Chair?","content":"<p>This esports gaming chair is built with a durable steel frame, high-density memory foam, and premium signature leatherette or fabric upholstery for long-lasting comfort and strength.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_67GbNx":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"5. Is the Budapest Major 2025 Athena Pro easy to assemble?","content":"<p>Yes. It comes with all the required hardware and clear step-by-step instructions, allowing most users to assemble it quickly without extra tools.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_xx8qEy":{"type":"conte